meta {
  name: List
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/gig
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## List Gigs — Public

  Returns a paginated list of active gigs with seller and category relations.

  ### Query Parameters
  | Parameter  | Type    | Description                                      |
  |-----------|---------|--------------------------------------------------|
  | page      | number  | Page number (default: 1)                         |
  | limit     | number  | Items per page (default: 50, max: 1000)          |
  | sortBy    | string  | Sort field: `created_at`, `updated_at`, `title`, `views`, `price` |
  | sortOrder | string  | `asc` or `desc`                                  |
  | category  | string  | Filter by category UUID                          |
  | seller    | string  | Filter by seller UUID                            |
  | search    | string  | Search in title and description                  |
  | tags      | string  | Comma-separated tag filter                       |
  | status    | string  | Filter by status (default: ACTIVE)               |

  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [...],
      "pagination": {
        "currentPage": 1,
        "pageSize": 20,
        "totalPages": 1,
        "total": 5,
        "hasNext": false,
        "hasPrev": false
      }
    }
  }
  ```
}
